<title>DENMARK: FLS takes over Australia's Circle.</title>
<headline>FLS takes over Australia's Circle.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish engineering and cement group FLS Industries said on Monday its FLS-Fuller Engineering group's FLS Automation unit had acquired a majority shareholding in Australian firm Circle Technology Pty Ltd.</p>
<p>No price for the deal was given.</p>
<p>It said that purchase of the Bowral, New South Wales-based firm reinforced FLS' activities in the supply of advanced processing automation equipment to the mining and cement industry in Australia.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
</text>
